/****** UP-List.mcc/UPA_List_MultiSelect ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_List_MultiSelect -- attribute of UP-List.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG UPV_List_MultiSelect_None/Default/Shifted/Always, as MUIA_Listview_MultiSelect. Shifted (and Default, which acts as Shifted): a plain click selects that row alone, Shift+click toggles it. Always: every click toggles the row. Selected rows draw like the active row. Read the selection with UPM_List_NextSelected, change it with UPM_List_Select. Keys move only the active row.
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_List_MultiSelect - access I G. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-List.mcc
*
******/

