/****** up-mcc.library/UP_SetLogHook ******
*
*   NAME
*       UP_SetLogHook -- up-mcc.library function
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Send every log line of the library and the classes to a struct Hook*. The hook message is the formatted NUL terminated line
*       (up to 255 bytes), the object is NULL. The hook runs whether or not ENV:UP-MCC/Debug is set. NULL removes it. One hook per process.
*
*   INPUTS
*       hook - struct Hook*, or NULL.
*
*   RESULT
*       None.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up_lib.h>, dist/sfd/up-mcc_lib.sfd
*
******/

/****** up-mcc.library/UP_DrawBar ******
*
*   NAME
*       UP_DrawBar -- up-mcc.library function
*
*   SYNOPSIS
*       result = UP_DrawBar(ctx, rp, bar)
*       D0                  A0   A1  A2
*
*   FUNCTION
*       The flat thumb-only UP-Scroller bar for every class that draws one (UP-Scroller, UP-TextArea): metrics, pens, paint and
*       pointer maths in one copy. The metrics come from the context (font_px, aspect_q8) on every call. bar->op selects:
*       UP_BAR_SETUP  hold the pens of every state (MUIM_Setup); returns width | min_h << 16.
*       UP_BAR_PAINT  draw the bar in the box x, y, w, h for first/visible/entries in the colours of state
*                     (MUI_AA_NORMAL, MUI_AA_HOVER, MUI_AA_PRESSED); returns 0.
*       UP_BAR_PRESS  a button press at row py of a bar h high: returns the new first (a click on the track pages towards the
*                     pointer) and sets grab to the pointer offset inside the thumb, -1 when the press missed it.
*       UP_BAR_DRAG   returns the first that puts the thumb, held at grab, under row py.
*       SETUP and PAINT do nothing on a context UP_DrawSetup refused.
*
*   INPUTS
*       ctx - the aa_ctx of the calling class (UP_DrawSetup).
*       rp  - struct RastPort* for UP_BAR_PAINT, else ignored.
*       bar - struct up_bar* (<mcc/up_lib.h>, ABI, append only).
*
*   RESULT
*       See FUNCTION.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       UP_DrawSetup, <mcc/up_lib.h>, dist/sfd/up-mcc_lib.sfd
*
******/

/****** up-mcc.library/UP_Log ******
*
