/****** UP-Text.mcc/UPA_Text_Timeout ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Text_Timeout -- attribute of UP-Text.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       ULONG milliseconds. A non-empty UPA_Text_Contents set clears the text
*       this long later (an MUIIHNF_TIMER input handler, armed only while the
*       object is set up). A newer text restarts the clock, so the newest
*       notice wins. 0 (default) keeps the text until the next set.
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Text_Timeout - access IS. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
