*       struct MUI_PenSpec*: the pen shown, MUI 3.8 format ("rRRRRRRRR,GGGGGGGG,BBBBBBBB" RGB, "pN" colormap pen, "mN" MUI pen; default "m5"). Notifies. Replaces MUIC_Pendisplay; also MUIA_Pendisplay_Pen (G, the screen pen or -1 for RGB), MUIA_Pendisplay_Reference (ISG, follows another Pendisplay) and MUIA_Pendisplay_RGBcolor (ISG struct MUI_RGBcolor*).
*
*   INPUTS
*       MUIA_Pendisplay_Spec - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Pendisplay.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Pendisplay.mcc/MUIM_Pendisplay_SetRGB ******
*
*   NAME
*       MUIM_Pendisplay_SetRGB -- method of UP-Pendisplay.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       MUIM_Pendisplay_SetRGB(red, green, blue), MUIM_Pendisplay_SetColormap(colormap) and MUIM_Pendisplay_SetMUIPen(muipen) set MUIA_Pendisplay_Spec (which notifies), as in MUI 3.8. Guns are 32 bit.
*
*   INPUTS
*       MUIM_Pendisplay_SetRGB - method. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Call with DoMethod(); returns 0.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Pendisplay.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Poppen.mcc/UPM_Poppen_Click ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPM_Poppen_Click -- method of UP-Poppen.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       UP-Poppen replaces MUIC_Poppen: a UP-Pendisplay (all its attributes and methods) that is a button. A click opens a UP-Penadjust in a popup window under the swatch; its changes set MUIA_Pendisplay_Spec. Leaving the popup closes it. UPM_Poppen_Click, UPM_Poppen_Closed and UPM_Poppen_Deactivated are internal.
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPM_Poppen_Click - internal method. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Call with DoMethod(); returns 0.
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Poppen.mcc
*
******/

