*
*   FUNCTION
*       BOOL: TRUE makes the object a MUIC_Coloradjust (RGB sliders only, no kind cycle). Otherwise it is a MUIC_Penadjust (cycle RGB / Colormap / MUI pen; MUIA_Penadjust_PSIMode TRUE leaves out MUI pen). Both modes answer MUIA_Pendisplay_Spec (ISG, notifies) and MUIA_Coloradjust_Red/Green/Blue (ISG ULONG 32 bit), MUIA_Coloradjust_RGB (ISG ULONG*[3]) and MUIA_Coloradjust_ModeID (ISG, stored only).
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Penadjust_Coloradjust - access I. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Penadjust.mcc
*
******/

