*
*   NAME
*       UPA_TextArea_MaxLen -- attribute of UP-TextArea.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG: capacity in bytes, default 1024 (a value below 1 gives the default); longer text is cut. Fixed at creation, a get returns the capacity
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_TextArea_MaxLen - access IG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
